1
00:01:32,210 --> 00:01:33,210
Hey, Daddy?

2
00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:33,580
Huh?

3
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:38,210
ALLEN - AGE 5

4
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,830
What's the Appraisal Ceremony like?

5
00:01:36,540 --> 00:01:39,290
It's a special event
that everyone from serf to noble

6
00:01:39,290 --> 00:01:41,750
has to participate in
when they turn five years old.

7
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:46,170
If you turn out to have a talent,
then you might be able to rise out of serfdom.

8
00:01:42,170 --> 00:01:48,670
EPISODE 2: THE APPRAISAL CEREMONY

9
00:01:46,830 --> 00:01:48,580
The only catch is, you have lots of rivals!

10
00:01:48,710 --> 00:01:49,670
Why is that?

11
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:53,380
As soon as we settled this land,
folks started poppin' out baby after baby.

12
00:01:54,170 --> 00:01:57,710
There are a lot of kids about to be
five years old. And that includes you.

13
00:01:57,710 --> 00:02:01,000
Allen! Let's go together!

14
00:02:01,250 --> 00:02:04,380
Oh, right. Like how Krena is the same age as me.

15
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:05,920
Exactly.

16
00:02:08,670 --> 00:02:10,540
Whoa! Check that out!

17
00:02:08,670 --> 00:02:10,540
Ow, ow, ow!

18
00:02:10,540 --> 00:02:13,420
There's so many houses! Amazing!

19
00:02:13,670 --> 00:02:15,880
That must be the commoner village.

20
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:25,170
If they appwaise me as Swordswoman,
then I'm gonna be a knight!

21
00:02:25,170 --> 00:02:26,830
Fingers crossed for you, kiddo!

22
00:02:33,830 --> 00:02:35,250
Is that the place?

23
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:36,040
That's right.

24
00:02:36,750 --> 00:02:39,380
Are those well-groomed people commoners?

25
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:42,540
I'm surprised, are we all undergoing
the ceremony at the same time?

26
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:40,750
I'm nervous...

27
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:42,540
Don't worry. Just be yourself.

28
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:42,960
Okay.

29
00:02:43,170 --> 00:02:45,380
They're obviously dressed better than we are...

30
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,710
Get a load of him. Dark hair, dark eyes.

31
00:02:50,130 --> 00:02:52,380
Don't see that often. Must be a serf.

32
00:02:52,540 --> 00:02:55,080
Yeah, I'm a serf. So what?

33
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:10,750
Elmea, the God of Creation,
blesses all of us equally with great opportunity.

34
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:15,500
This country has seen heroes whose lineage
can even be traced back to serfdom.

35
00:03:15,670 --> 00:03:16,710
Heroes who were serfs?

36
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:17,830
Is that true?

37
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:21,830
For example, Clasys the Saintess
was a commoner by birth.

38
00:03:21,830 --> 00:03:26,750
And Dverg the Sword Lord was but a serf.

39
00:03:28,210 --> 00:03:30,170
Ah, that's right!

40
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:34,830
It did say classes like Hero and Sword Lord
have to start from a low social class.

41
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:38,580
Those were just game configurations,
but I guess they apply to the world as a whole.

42
00:03:39,380 --> 00:03:44,130
So it makes sense why everyone from top to bottom
has to undergo the ceremony. Good stuff!

43
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,880
Please, come inside.

44
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:47,630
A'ight!

45
00:03:48,830 --> 00:03:50,830
Appwaisal Ceremony! Let's go!

46
00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:04,000
Those must be the Gods worshipped here.

47
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:07,790
The one in the middle is Elmea, God of Creation.

48
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:12,210
SINCE YOU SELECTED A CLASS STILL UNDER TESTING,

49
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:12,210
IT TOOK TIME TO FINISH THE APPROPRIATE PAPERWORK.

50
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:12,210
OUR STAFF WORKED HARD TO FINISH

51
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:12,210
AS SOON AS WE COULD.

52
00:04:08,290 --> 00:04:12,210
PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT ACCEPT ANY QUESTIONS

53
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:12,210
OR CANCELLATIONS IN REGARDS TO CLASS SELECTION.

54
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:12,210
SINCERELY, ELMEA - THE GOD OF CREATION

55
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:11,880
Reminds me of that time the devs sent me a letter.

56
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:16,380
We shall now begin
the Appraisal Ceremony. First up...

57
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:17,960
Village chieftain, Deboji.

58
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:18,790
Here.

59
00:04:18,790 --> 00:04:20,500
And your son, Pelomas.

60
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:21,210
Yessir.

61
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,960
By placing your hand on this crystal ball,

62
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:28,790
any talent and attributes that you have
shall be inscribed on the metal plate behind me.

63
00:04:29,170 --> 00:04:32,000
Pelomas, my boy. Step up
and place your hand on it.

64
00:04:32,330 --> 00:04:33,330
Um, okay.

65
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:40,500
Pelomas...

66
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:43,920
You can do it!

67
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,460
It's just like the stat page in my grimoire!

