189
00:07:55,750 --> 00:07:57,290
Shit! These useless devs!

190
00:07:57,290 --> 00:07:59,750
"Elmea the God of Creation", my ass!

191
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,750
Learn how to debug your game! You scrub!

192
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:04,920
Now nobody will know that I'm a summoner, dammit!

193
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:09,630
C'mon, Allen. Let's head home.

194
00:08:10,170 --> 00:08:11,330
Mommy's waiting.

195
00:08:17,130 --> 00:08:18,960
Welcome home!

196
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:19,670
We're back.

197
00:08:19,670 --> 00:08:20,500
We're home.

198
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,540
Hey there, Mash.

199
00:08:24,250 --> 00:08:26,170
Were you a good boy?

200
00:08:29,330 --> 00:08:31,040
Talents don't matter, anyway.

201
00:08:31,170 --> 00:08:33,420
You're always going to be our pride and joy!

202
00:08:33,710 --> 00:08:35,080
That's right, Allen.

203
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:39,500
Big Bwudda!

204
00:08:40,710 --> 00:08:42,790
So poor we don't even have a bathtub.

205
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:46,460
But I'm still happy I was born
into this family, regardless.

206
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:51,040
Although, I'm older than all of them...

207
00:08:57,420 --> 00:08:59,380
All my attributes are E rank.

208
00:09:00,170 --> 00:09:02,170
I learned at least one thing today.

209
00:09:02,630 --> 00:09:06,040
I'm the only one in this world
playing on Hell Mode.

210
00:09:06,580 --> 00:09:08,670
Everyone at the Appraisal Ceremony
was five years old,

211
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:11,290
which means they should all be level one like me.

212
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:16,250
The rank system probably reflects
the amount of growth that they can expect

213
00:09:16,250 --> 00:09:17,790
whenever they level up.

214
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:21,670
So I assume the reason why
all my attributes are E rank...

