HELL

220
00:09:24,330 --> 00:09:30,210
HELL MODE:

221
00:09:24,330 --> 00:09:30,210
ACQUIRING SKILLS AND LEVELING THEM UP REQUIRES

222
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:30,210
100 TIMES MORE EXP THAN NORMAL MODE.

223
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:30,210
THERE IS NO LEVEL CAP. THIS IS A GACHA-FREE

224
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:30,210
SYSTEM, SO ONLY THE SKILLS ASSOCIATED WITH YOUR

225
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:30,210
CHOSEN CLASS ARE OBTAINABLE AT THE START.

226
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:27,670
...is because my progress in Hell Mode
is a hundredth of the norm.

227
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:29,880
And when you take that into account,

228
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:33,170
my ranks must be showing
the same fraction of their actual value.

229
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:33,830
REGRET IS THE LEAST OF YOUR WORRIES.

230
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:33,830
FOR YOU SHALL BE FACED WITH UTTER DESPAIR.

231
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:33,830
SHOULD YOU PROVE CAPABLE OF OVERCOMING DESPAIR,

232
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:33,830
YOU SHALL DISCOVER THE PRINCIPLE OF THE WORLD.

233
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:33,830
THIS MODE WAS MADE FOR FUN

234
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:33,830
BY THE DEVELOPMENT STAFF.

235
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:39,670
During a boom of weaksauce games, I got reborn
in a world where I'm the only one on Hell Mode.

236
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:43,170
Heh. This would make normal people
pull their hair out.

237
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:47,130
But not me! I'm here to put
weaksauce games in their place!

238
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:51,000
I'll spend my life proving
that hardcore gaming is where its at!

239
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:52,250
Except...

240
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:55,670
TALENT: RU?NEMOM/SH

241
00:09:52,710 --> 00:09:55,250
...that weird text was obviously a glitch.

242
00:09:55,670 --> 00:09:57,790
The devs have gotta fix this shit!

243
00:09:57,960 --> 00:10:00,290
Time to complain!
I'll drown them in a sea of letters!

244
00:10:00,420 --> 00:10:03,040
Don't underestimate a gamer who has no life!

245
00:10:07,290 --> 00:10:08,380
Hey, Mommy.

246
00:10:09,250 --> 00:10:10,420
What's wrong with Daddy?

247
00:10:10,670 --> 00:10:13,960
He's been like that ever since
he got home late last night.

248
00:10:14,330 --> 00:10:15,630
Huh...

249
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:19,670
Thanks for comin', y'all! We appreciate it!

250
00:10:20,130 --> 00:10:24,130
Of course. Krena being
a Sword Lord is worth celebrating.

251
00:10:24,630 --> 00:10:25,580
Congratulations!

252
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:26,880
Thanks!

253
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:30,670
Hey, Allen, didja know? Sword Lord
is even better than Swordswoman!

254
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:33,880
Whoa! Is that right?

255
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:35,210
Gotta play dumb.

256
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:38,580
Yeah! So now I'm gonna get even stronger!

257
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:41,170
Shucks. But you already trample all over me.

258
00:10:41,170 --> 00:10:42,290
Oh, guess what?

259
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:45,960
The chieftain stopped by earlier
and gifted us this celebratory liquor!

260
00:10:46,250 --> 00:10:48,080
I'll let you guys crack it open.

261
00:10:48,290 --> 00:10:48,960
Here, hon.

262
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:53,080
Well, congrats. Enjoy the booze.

263
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,960
Guests drink first in this house.

264
00:10:57,210 --> 00:11:00,920
Hmm. Is he jealous over
the whole Sword Lord thing?

265
00:11:01,250 --> 00:11:03,750
Nah, Dad's not that petty.

266
00:11:04,130 --> 00:11:04,880
Drink up.

267
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:08,130
Forget it! I'm not drinking anything you pour
with that sour look on your face.

268
00:11:08,130 --> 00:11:09,920
Hey, don't give me that!

269
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:12,250
Then quit being such a buzzkill about this!

270
00:11:12,250 --> 00:11:13,830
I'm happy for you, dammit!

271
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:17,880
Krena has an amazing talent!
That's cause for celebration!

272
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:21,170
Fine! Then why the hell did you say
you were cutting ties with our family?!

273
00:11:22,330 --> 00:11:22,960
Huh?!

274
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:25,330
It's not like I want to!

275
00:11:25,630 --> 00:11:28,790
But hear me out. Krena's talent is extraordinary.

276
00:11:29,210 --> 00:11:33,380
She can join the knighthood and serve the country.

277
00:11:33,670 --> 00:11:35,790
There's a good chance
she can even become nobility!

278
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:38,210
People with talent like that shouldn't
waste their time socializing with serfs!

279
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:41,500
Ah. He's trying to do them
a favor they didn't ask for.

280
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:42,710
Sword Lord is a big deal!

281
00:11:43,830 --> 00:11:45,170
That doesn't make a damn difference!

282
00:11:45,170 --> 00:11:47,250
Like hell it doesn't, you blockhead!

283
00:11:47,250 --> 00:11:48,210
Ugh, what a headache.

284
00:11:48,210 --> 00:11:50,210
Why are so you hung up on this?!

285
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:50,210
But I better do something.

286
00:11:50,210 --> 00:11:53,580
What part of "Sword Lord" don't you get?!

287
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:53,580
Hey, Krena? Maybe you
should make them settle down.

288
00:11:53,580 --> 00:11:54,380
I'm on it!

289
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:56,830
Enough, hon! Knock it off!

290
00:11:56,830 --> 00:11:58,500
You, too, Rodin!

291
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,500
Gerda.

292
00:12:01,500 --> 00:12:02,580
Stay out of this, wo-

293
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:13,250
All taken care of.

294
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:17,830
Never mess with a woman.

295
00:12:18,210 --> 00:12:21,790
Hey, Auntie? Have they
always butt heads like this?

296
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:25,630
Yep. Fatherhood has helped them mellow out,

297
00:12:26,210 --> 00:12:29,880
but they used to be hotheads who
threw punches at each other all the time.

298
00:12:30,170 --> 00:12:31,420
Ah, the old days.

299
00:12:31,540 --> 00:12:34,080
You know, Allen, the four of us
are actually childhood friends

300
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:36,710
who grew up in the same village together.

301
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,330
Oh really?

302
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:43,130
Ten years ago, word went around
about settling a new village.

303
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:45,630
And we all decided
to join that effort together.

304
00:12:45,830 --> 00:12:48,210
I remember we had a group discussion

305
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:50,880
about working together
to build our own houses.

306
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:54,920
Have you noticed this house
has the same design as ours?

307
00:12:55,210 --> 00:12:56,330
Oh, you're right!

308
00:12:56,830 --> 00:12:59,330
It was easier to just build both at the same time.

309
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:01,630
Given the labor and supplies needed.

310
00:13:01,630 --> 00:13:03,420
I'm the one who put up the support beams.

311
00:13:03,630 --> 00:13:05,830
Well, I'm the one built the walls and floors.

312
00:13:07,750 --> 00:13:09,670
Yeah, well, I did the roofs.

313
00:13:12,830 --> 00:13:14,000
Liquor, huh?

314
00:13:14,750 --> 00:13:16,130
Haven't had any since my wedding day.

315
00:13:16,580 --> 00:13:17,630
Same here.

316
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:20,710
Ow!

317
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:23,710
Does it sting, hon? Sorry about that.

318
00:13:23,710 --> 00:13:24,960
Aw, it's nothin'!

319
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:33,290
Hey, Gerda!

320
00:13:33,750 --> 00:13:34,330
Huh?

321
00:13:36,130 --> 00:13:39,080
The Order of Knights? They're coming to see Krena?

322
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:50,000
THE HARDCORE GAMER DOMINATES

323
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:50,000
IN ANOTHER WORLD WITH GARBAGE BALANCING

324
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:54,710
Knights! Knights! Knights!

325
00:13:54,710 --> 00:13:55,750
There's the Sword Lord.

326
00:13:54,710 --> 00:14:00,170
Knights! Knights! Knights!

327
00:13:56,170 --> 00:13:57,460
She's just a kid.

328
00:13:57,670 --> 00:13:59,580
Seems like word about Krena is spreading.

329
00:14:00,170 --> 00:14:01,420
Hey, dirthead!

330
00:14:02,210 --> 00:14:04,330
Think I remember this kid
from the Appraisal Ceremony.

331
00:14:04,670 --> 00:14:08,170
Already flaunting his talent as an Axe User, huh?
If you can call that big stick an axe.

332
00:14:08,460 --> 00:14:09,960
What do you think you're doing?

333
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:12,210
Talentless losers have no place here!

334
00:14:12,210 --> 00:14:13,580
Cuz Allen is strong!

335
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:14,830
As-if! He's a weakling!

336
00:14:14,830 --> 00:14:16,790
All his ranks were E! And he's a serf!

337
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,330
That's enough, Krena.

338
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:20,380
Lemme go!

339
00:14:21,460 --> 00:14:23,750
The Order of Knights has arrived!

340
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,670
Make way!

341
00:14:28,250 --> 00:14:29,750
So cool!

342
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,830
There's the captain! He's a Sword Master!

343
00:14:30,210 --> 00:14:33,130
KNIGHT CAPTAIN: ZENOF

344
00:14:33,130 --> 00:14:35,330
They're here! Knights! Knights! Knights!

345
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:34,540
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

346
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:37,080
Chieftain.

347
00:14:37,580 --> 00:14:39,000
Welcome, my good sir!

348
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:45,040
Come here! Krena, Gerda!

349
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:46,790
Kniiiiights!

350
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,880
Krena's beyond excited.

351
00:14:49,330 --> 00:14:51,750
It's been three years since
we first started playing knights.

352
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:54,330
And now she's meeting the real thing!

353
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:56,500
You must be the Sword Lord.

354
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:57,960
Yeah! I'm Krena!

355
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,790
Say "sir"!

356
00:14:58,790 --> 00:14:59,460
Sir!

357
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:06,580
I wonder if Krena will leave
the village to become a knight now?

358
00:15:06,790 --> 00:15:08,210
Kinda tugs at the heartstrings.

359
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:09,630
Please wait!

360
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:14,000
My daughter is only five years old
and hasn't even touched a real sword before!

361
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,080
She wouldn't stand a chance!

362
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:18,920
But she's a Sword Lord, is she not?
What's the problem?

363
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:21,540
Unless you're afraid to admit that you lied.

364
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:24,670
Is this some kind of trick
to fool Baron Granvelle?

365
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:28,000
Of course not, sir! It's just...

366
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,250
Vice-Captain!

367
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:30,750
Make ready.

368
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:31,630
Yessir!

369
00:15:32,130 --> 00:15:33,170
Please don't, sir!

370
00:15:33,250 --> 00:15:36,040
What's going on? Something seems wrong.

371
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,880
Falsifying the results of the Appraisal Ceremony
is punishable by death.

372
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:43,920
We must determine whether this young lady's talent
as Sword Lord is legitimate.

373
00:15:44,670 --> 00:15:47,000
Thus we shall now hold a fencing duel!

374
00:15:48,170 --> 00:15:49,460
Did I just hear that right?!

375
00:15:49,540 --> 00:15:50,960
Have mercy, sir!

376
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:53,420
My daughter's life is at stake here!

377
00:15:53,540 --> 00:15:58,080
She must fight. Or we'll execute her
and her family on the spot.

378
00:15:59,290 --> 00:16:01,500
What the hell? That's not fair at all!

379
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:03,170
Have these people lost their minds?!

380
00:16:08,210 --> 00:16:09,210
K-Krena!

381
00:16:09,210 --> 00:16:11,710
Hey, mister! Do I get to use that sword?

382
00:16:11,710 --> 00:16:12,380
Yes.

383
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:15,420
It's okay, Daddy! I'll do it!

384
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:18,290
Oh, jeez... seriously?

385
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:32,500
I am Krena the Knight!
I challenge you! Have at thee!

386
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:32,750
TALENT:

387
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:32,750
SWORD LORD

388
00:16:33,170 --> 00:16:35,880
My name is Leibrand. I accept your challenge.

389
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:36,210
TALENT:

390
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:36,210
SPEAR USER

391
00:16:36,290 --> 00:16:37,580
K-Krena...

392
00:16:46,330 --> 00:16:49,460
Holy moley! How can she use
a sword that's nearly as tall as her?!

393
00:16:52,710 --> 00:16:57,170
Krena's "Sword Mastery" skill should be about
level five thanks to our daily playfighting.

394
00:16:57,380 --> 00:17:00,460
But I'm not sure how much
that will actually help her...

395
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:06,000
Krena!

396
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:14,710
Krena!

397
00:17:15,750 --> 00:17:18,000
Get off me, assholes! That's my daughter!

398
00:17:18,540 --> 00:17:19,670
Krena!

399
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:23,670
Dammit! It's obviously too much for her!

400
00:17:23,830 --> 00:17:28,130
She may be a Sword Lord, but adults
still have the advantage in skill and level!

401
00:17:44,330 --> 00:17:46,540
This is an Extra Skill...

402
00:17:46,830 --> 00:17:47,750
Krena!

403
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:56,290
The duel is over!

404
00:17:57,290 --> 00:17:59,040
Lower your weapons.

405
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:01,500
Huh? It's over already?

406
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:03,790
Thanks so much!

407
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:05,420
You're super strong, gramps!

408
00:18:05,670 --> 00:18:10,880
24 YEARS OLD

409
00:18:06,540 --> 00:18:09,330
Uh, I'm actually not that old...

410
00:18:12,330 --> 00:18:14,830
That little girl just beat
the vice-captain of the knights!

411
00:18:14,830 --> 00:18:17,670
She's the real deal! A Sword Lord!

412
00:18:20,630 --> 00:18:22,210
That's my girl!

413
00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:24,250
Krena survived!

414
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,630
Oh man, I almost had a heart attack there.

415
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:34,330
Talk about being tougher than nails.

416
00:18:34,670 --> 00:18:37,830
Well, I'll be. There's no refuting this.

417
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:40,750
Hold on. You're not hurt anywhere, are you?

418
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:42,460
Daddy! That tickles!

419
00:18:42,460 --> 00:18:43,080
Gerda.

420
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:47,250
I commend you on raising a Sword Lord.

421
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,330
Let me apologize for my boorishness.

422
00:18:53,130 --> 00:18:55,380
Your daughter has a marvelous talent.

423
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:59,710
Hence, I would like a chance
to discuss her future with you.

424
00:18:59,710 --> 00:19:00,920
Well, I'm not so sure...

425
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:03,580
Please bring your friends,
if it makes you more comfortable.

426
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:11,710
CHIEFTAIN'S RESIDENCE

427
00:19:13,630 --> 00:19:15,580
The big guy's still upset.

428
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:17,710
Guess I can't blame him.

429
00:19:18,290 --> 00:19:21,130
I get why the captain
and the chieftain's son are here...

430
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:23,540
But what's with axe boy and his dad?

431
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:26,460
Trying not to get overshadowed by the Sword Lord?

432
00:19:26,830 --> 00:19:29,580
Anyways, I'm gonna sneak
some of this molmo fruit home!

433
00:19:30,170 --> 00:19:31,880
Please feel free to eat while I talk.

434
00:19:32,710 --> 00:19:36,250
Let me introduce myself.
I am Zenof, captain of the knights.

435
00:19:36,750 --> 00:19:39,880
I was sent here by the order
of my lord to determine

436
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:42,830
whether a true Sword Lord was among us.

437
00:19:43,380 --> 00:19:45,290
And the results were crystal clear.

438
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:47,080
So, Chief Deboji.

439
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,250
Uh, yessir!

440
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:52,210
This frontier village was set to be named
after you once it was fully established.

441
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:58,500
However, now that we know a Sword Lord
has been born here, my lord has declared

442
00:19:59,170 --> 00:20:02,580
that we should honor this momentous
occasion by naming it "Krena Village" instead.

443
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:03,920
Huh?!

444
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:06,330
Y-yes, very well!

445
00:20:06,710 --> 00:20:09,080
I respect the baron's decision, of course.

446
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:10,500
Sorry for the change.

447
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:14,920
Three years back, there was
a Sword Lord born to the family of a count.

448
00:20:15,330 --> 00:20:21,630
Wait. I'm pretty sure Sword Lords can only be born
in the serf, commoner, or baron social classes.

449
00:20:22,250 --> 00:20:27,500
That particular individual went on to serve
the royal family, but failed to meet expectations.

450
00:20:27,710 --> 00:20:29,790
This led to a re-appraisal,

451
00:20:29,790 --> 00:20:32,420
in which it was made clear their talent
was that of an ordinary Swordsman.

452
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:37,250
Afterwards, it was discovered numerous members
of nobility had exaggerated their talents.

453
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:41,960
Therefore, the kingdom has made it a point
to thoroughly verify all results.

454
00:20:42,290 --> 00:20:44,580
Well, that's understandable.

455
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:50,040
Gerda, my chum. Please forgive me for
putting your daughter through such a harsh trial.

456
00:20:50,210 --> 00:20:51,040
Sure.

457
00:20:51,630 --> 00:20:55,500
It goes without saying, but please continue to
raise Krena and help her flourish as a Sword Lord.

458
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:59,130
When she reaches the age of 12,
she can go study at the Academy.

459
00:20:59,330 --> 00:21:02,460
And eventually, serve directly
under the royal family.

460
00:21:02,670 --> 00:21:05,630
Oh! So there's an academy for people with talents?

461
00:21:05,630 --> 00:21:08,210
Can anybody who goes
to the academy become a knight?

462
00:21:08,210 --> 00:21:09,710
Hey, Dogora!

463
00:21:09,710 --> 00:21:12,040
Please forgive him for
talking out of turn, Sir Zenof!

464
00:21:12,460 --> 00:21:13,170
Is he your boy?

465
00:21:13,170 --> 00:21:16,210
Yessir. This here is my son, Dogora.

466
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:18,920
As it happens, he was appraised
with the Axe User talent.

467
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:22,330
And he's always going on about
how he'd like to be a knight...

468
00:21:22,580 --> 00:21:25,540
Gotta hand it to him.
This guy knows how to schmooze.

469
00:21:25,880 --> 00:21:26,670
I see.

470
00:21:27,290 --> 00:21:30,500
At some point, an instructor
will be dispatched to this village.

471
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:34,210
Do your best to study and earn
admission into the Academy.

472
00:21:34,210 --> 00:21:35,080
Gotcha!

473
00:21:35,170 --> 00:21:37,630
You gotta study with us, Allen!

474
00:21:37,750 --> 00:21:39,330
Uh, sure.

475
00:21:39,330 --> 00:21:41,290
Dirthead ain't got the brains for it!

476
00:21:41,290 --> 00:21:43,380
He can't study himself out of a paper bag!

477
00:21:43,380 --> 00:21:44,580
Can, too!

478
00:21:44,580 --> 00:21:46,210
Nah, he's dumb as rocks!

479
00:21:46,210 --> 00:21:47,380
That's just what you think!

480
00:21:47,380 --> 00:21:49,380
Whatever! Dummy!

481
00:21:47,380 --> 00:21:50,830
Yeesh, I've got five year olds
harassing me and defending me.

482
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:52,670
Little do they know that I'm 40 inside.

483
00:21:53,170 --> 00:21:56,830
Dark hair and dark eyes... who is this boy?

484
00:21:57,290 --> 00:21:59,380
This is my son, Sir Zenof!

485
00:21:59,710 --> 00:22:03,210
Oh, sorry. Let me introduce
my best friend. His name is Rodin.

486
00:22:03,460 --> 00:22:06,380
Rodin? You mean Rodin the Boar Hunter?!

487
00:22:06,380 --> 00:22:06,750
Huh?

488
00:22:07,130 --> 00:22:08,580
How rude of me!

489
00:22:08,580 --> 00:22:10,290
Why didn't you say so earlier?

490
00:22:10,630 --> 00:22:13,080
I need to pay proper respect to a village legend!

491
00:22:13,670 --> 00:22:16,630
"Legend"? Pardon, but how do know my name?

492
00:22:17,330 --> 00:22:20,830
Well, the baron is most fond
of the Great Boar meat that is supplied

493
00:22:20,830 --> 00:22:23,670
by this village each winter, you see.

494
00:22:23,670 --> 00:22:24,670
Ah.

495
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:27,630
They really struggled to hunt that huge boar down,

496
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:30,630
but I guess the baron reaps
most of the benefit, huh?

497
00:22:31,380 --> 00:22:33,630
From what I've heard,

498
00:22:33,630 --> 00:22:36,880
Rodin is the man responsible for taking on
the most dangerous role in the hunts.

499
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:39,210
You're a veritable hero!

500
00:22:39,670 --> 00:22:43,580
It's not just me saying this.
Please consider it praise from the baron himself.

501
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:45,170
Why thank you!

502
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:47,670
Dad's a superstar!

503
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:58,130
Ya know, Krena might become a hero
right out of the storybooks someday.

504
00:22:58,460 --> 00:23:00,250
Gosh, you think so?

505
00:23:01,830 --> 00:23:05,830
But go figure. Even serfs like me
can get recognized by the bigshots.

506
00:23:06,790 --> 00:23:09,460
Let's keep at it, okay?
We'll strut our stuff with pride!

507
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,080
No matter how hard the work is.

508
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:13,130
You got it, Daddy!

509
00:23:13,670 --> 00:23:16,380
He's preaching to the choir.
I'm playing on Hell Mode, after all.

510
00:23:17,210 --> 00:23:18,630
You'll do great things, son.

511
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:20,920
Cuz you've got my genes in you!

512
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:22,880
Oh, I almost forgot.

513
00:23:23,040 --> 00:23:25,710
I snuck out some gifts for Mommy and Mash...

514
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:27,250
Was that a bad thing to do?

515
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:30,790
Whoa!

516
00:23:31,380 --> 00:23:32,210
So did I!

517
00:23:36,630 --> 00:23:38,080
You're the best, Daddy!

518
00:23:38,080 --> 00:23:39,130
C'mon, let's head home!

